Detect WiFi Networks (Aircrack-ng)
Aircrack-ng suite helps discover nearby wireless networks.
Enables monitoring signal strength, channels, and encryption types.
Used in ethical auditing to check network security posture.
⚠️ Attempting to break WiFi passwords without permission is illegal.

Key Grabber
Hardware or software designed to capture keystrokes typed by a user.
Demonstrates risks of physical access or malware infection.
Used in labs to study data-exfiltration and endpoint protection.
⚠️ Unauthorized monitoring of user input violates privacy laws.
